flowchart TD
Start["**Start**<br/>MOO optimization entry"]
BufferProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Defines six integer decision variables<br/>Each capacity range {1-10}"]
NSGA2Alg["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Generates and evolves population<br/>Uses SBX crossover and PM mutation"]
Population["**Population**<br/>Set of candidate capacity vectors"]
EvaluatePopulation["**Evaluate Population**<br/>BufferCapacityProblem _evaluate invoked by optimizer"]
Multipool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>Parallel map across n_cores for individuals"]
EvalSingle["**evaluate_single_individual**<br/>Evaluates one individual across replications"]
Feasibility["**Feasibility Check**<br/>All capacities integer and within {1-10}"]
PenaltyReturn["**Penalty Return**<br/>Return large penalty objectives to skip simulation"]
RunSimulation["**run_simulation**<br/>Builds sim environment using candidate caps<br/>Runs warmup and measurement replications"]
DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer Class**<br/>Buffer cap and delay behavior<br/>Tracks in transit and ready items"]
MachineClass["**Machine Class**<br/>Processing logic availability failures<br/>Collects working waiting blocked metrics"]
AggregateMetrics["**Aggregate Metrics**<br/>Compute avg WIP and avg throughput across reps"]
Objectives["**Return Objectives**<br/>Objective 1 minimize WIP<br/>Objective 2 minimize negative throughput"]
UpdatePopulation["**NSGA2 Update**<br/>Assign fitness perform selection crossover mutation"]
Termination["**Termination Check**<br/>Stop after configured number of generations"]
ExportCSV["**Export CSV**<br/>export_history_to_csv writes population history and KPIs"]
End["**End**<br/>Optimization complete with Pareto front"]

Start --> BufferProblem --> NSGA2Alg --> Population --> EvaluatePopulation --> Multipool
Multipool --> EvalSingle
EvalSingle --> Feasibility
Feasibility -- infeasible --> PenaltyReturn --> Objectives
Feasibility -- feasible --> RunSimulation
RunSimulation --> DelayBufferClass
RunSimulation --> MachineClass
RunSimulation --> AggregateMetrics --> Objectives
Objectives --> MultipoolResults{"**Pool Collect Results**<br/>Gather objectives for population"}
MultipoolResults --> UpdatePopulation
UpdatePopulation --> Termination
Termination -- not finished --> NSGA2Alg
Termination -- finished --> ExportCSV --> End